[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7741.189, "timestamp": "02:09:01", "text": "哇。嗯？是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7743.83, "timestamp": "02:09:03", "text": "实际上，这里的内容都是你看到的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7745.27, "timestamp": "02:09:05", "text": "就像你背着一个背包，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7748.39, "timestamp": "02:09:08", "text": "里面装满了东西。背包是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7749.99, "timestamp": "02:09:09", "text": "等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7751.75, "timestamp": "02:09:11", "text": "所以，我们有一种叫做符咒的东西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7753.27, "timestamp": "02:09:13", "text": "就像你玩的那些有趣的小玩具一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7757.27, "timestamp": "02:09:17", "text": "可以一起玩，他们喜欢我可以做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7760.229, "timestamp": "02:09:20", "text": "各种各样的事情，比如我可以做我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7762.229, "timestamp": "02:09:22", "text": "给你一个叫卡尔的东西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7763.99, "timestamp": "02:09:23", "text": "它会给你一个不错的伴侣，但它确实"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7766.47, "timestamp": "02:09:26", "text": "如果你说话太多，可能会引起惊吓。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7767.91, "timestamp": "02:09:27", "text": "高声。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7770.31, "timestamp": "02:09:30", "text": "我会做史莱姆，那基本上就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7779.83, "timestamp": "02:09:39", "text": "有闪光弹，但是，嗯，再说一遍，那是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7782.149, "timestamp": "02:09:42", "text": "突然惊吓。所以，为了解释这一点，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7784.31, "timestamp": "02:09:44", "text": "如果你有的话，它只会给你一个闪光弹。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7785.99, "timestamp": "02:09:45", "text": "从来没有过，然后它就自动跳过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7788.189, "timestamp": "02:09:48", "text": "这个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7792.95, "timestamp": "02:09:52", "text": "嗯，我们有极其罕见的，它变成了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7795.589, "timestamp": "02:09:55", "text": "你被装进袜子里。我们还有一罐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7799.589, "timestamp": "02:09:59", "text": "带着罪恶感的屁味的豆子。哇。有"}]